WEBVTT

00:12:29.497 --> 00:12:30.663
You know ...

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:33.430
I think back to the first time

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:37.497
I tried the virtual reality lab product
I'd helped to build.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:42.363
A team of so many
brilliant, talented people

00:12:42.397 --> 00:12:44.263
had worked on it for months.

00:12:45.097 --> 00:12:48.797
I slipped on the VR headset,
and there I was,

00:12:49.797 --> 00:12:51.597
a lab bench in front of me.

00:12:52.363 --> 00:12:56.163
The focus was a fundamental
microbiology method.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:02.597
It was probably one of the first things
my dad learned when he was in grad school,